File system {{mount.name}} on firewall {{device_ip.name}} is {{value}}% full. Logging, updates and commits may fail. Run `show system disk-space` to confirm the full mount, then free space by deleting unused software images (`delete software version <version>`) or old debug and core files.
{{/is_alert}}

